        "Content": "Leonard Wilson Keenan \r\n\r\nOur Business is you..\r\n\r\n3 bedroom, 1 bathroom semi-detached family home.\r\nEarly viewing is advised \r\nPerfect for renovation\r\n\r\nRichard Todd and Leonard Wilson Keenan are delighted to present 48 St Brigids to the Dublin 5 property market.\r\nNestled within one of Artane's most established and family-friendly residential locations, No. 48 St Brigid's Drive is a charming three-bedroom semi-detached family home boasting a beautiful red-brick façade, off-street parking, and enormous potential for its next owners to create a wonderful forever home.\r\n\r\nUpon arrival, a porch entrance leads into a bright and inviting hallway. To the right, the front reception room enjoys an abundance of natural light from a large window overlooking the front garden, creating the perfect space for family relaxation.\r\n\r\nMoving through the elegant French pocket doors, you enter the main living room, a warm and comfortable space centred around a feature fireplace. This room enjoys pleasant views over the rear garden and sunroom, providing an ideal setting for both everyday family living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nReturning to the hallway, the property opens into a spacious kitchen/dining area, offering excellent potential for modernisation and redesign. The kitchen provides direct access to the rear garden, creating a seamless connection between indoor and outdoor living.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the accommodation comprises two generously sized double bedrooms, one of which benefits from fitted wardrobes, together with a well-proportioned single bedroom. A family bathroom completes the first-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nWhile the property would benefit from some modernisation and TLC, it presents a fantastic opportunity for buyers seeking to put their own stamp on a home in a highly sought-after Dublin 5 location.\r\n\r\nArtane remains one of Dublin's most popular residential suburbs, renowned for its mature surroundings, excellent amenities, and strong sense of community. The area is particularly appealing to families thanks to its wide selection of highly regarded primary and secondary schools, excellent transport links, and abundance of local services.\r\n\r\nResidents are within easy reach of Artane Castle Shopping Centre, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, sports clubs, parks, and recreational facilities. Nearby green spaces include the magnificent St. Anne's Park and the scenic Clontarf seafront, both ideal for outdoor enthusiasts.\r\n\r\nThe property enjoys excellent connectivity, with regular bus services operating nearby and DART stations at Harmonstown and Killester providing convenient access to Dublin City Centre. Killester is located approximately 5km from the city centre, while Dublin Airport can be reached in approximately 15 minutes by car, making it an ideal location for commuters and frequent travellers alike.\r\n\r\nNo. 48 St Brigid's Drive offers a rare opportunity to acquire a home full of character, potential, and possibilities in a well-established and highly convenient Dublin 5.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
